# Financial Data Analysis Using Nasdaq Data Link

This project explores financial statement data retrieved via the Nasdaq Data Link API.
The analysis focuses on EBITDA margins across companies and over time.

## Contents
- `Basics.ipynb`: Data ingestion, cleaning, analysis, and visualization

## Highlights
- API-based data retrieval
- EBITDA margin distribution analysis
- Time-series smoothing with moving averages
- Clear matplotlib visualizations

## Tools Used
- Python
- pandas
- matplotlib
- requests
- Jupyter Notebook

## Notes
The notebook is fully rendered on GitHub and includes all charts and outputs.
API keys are excluded for security reasons.
